{% if stage in ["stage1", "all"] %}
- Stage 1 L0 compiler sources under `compiler/stage1_l0/`
{% endif %}
{% if stage in ["stage2", "all"] %}
- Stage 2 L1 compiler sources under `compiler/stage2_l1/src/`
